@section 14. Bugs

@para
File issues at `https://github.com/paideia-os/cp/issues`. Include
the exact invocation and argv, and (if `--verbose` was passed) any
stderr diagnostic line it printed. `--version` does not print a
build hash or signature fingerprint at 1.0.x (see §4.2) — quote the
tag/commit you built from instead.

